    {
      "description": "Readium Mobile is a toolkit for ebooks, PDF documents, audiobooks and comics written in Swift & Kotlin. It targets primarily Android, iOS and iPadOS but can also be useful to build macOS and Chrome OS apps. With hundreds of apps using Readium Mobile and an open license (BSD-3), it's impossible to track down every single app built on top of it. This list is meant to identify some of them, to illustrate its adoption around the world.",
      "items": [],
